  -   - Call [Plan Available Work](#plan-available-work) with current items, pull requests, complete issue links, project checkout, evaluated revision, epic bases, engineering worktree, resolved off-board issues, the authorization's optional requested lane index and selected record date, requesting its dispatch export.
