  +
  +- Apply [Place Issue on Board](#place-issue-on-board) with the board in [Board Evidence](#board-evidence), the hot-fix issue and Ready.
  +
  +- Retain [Board Result](#board-result) with the saved item and Status.
  +
  +##### Survey Continuation
  +
  +- Repeat the survey with refreshed items and delivery evidence after a release.
  +
  +- Retain held, blocked, undeclared and unresolved findings for the report.
  +
  +#### 4. Record Merge Results
