  +- For a draft with passing evidence, Run [Mark Review Ready](#mark-review-ready) with the node id its metadata names.
  +
  +- Apply [Read Pull Request State](#read-pull-request-state) again with the same identity, then Run [Validate Agent Review](#validate-agent-review) again with that fresh metadata and the same published records. Retain [Review State](#review-state), or [Failure](#failure) with the changed revision or finding that leaves it unconfirmed.
  +
  +##### Repair Hot-Fix Findings
  +
  +- For each provided finding, fix it on the task branch and repeat this step from Produce Agent Review, until review validation and ready-state readback provide no finding.
  +- A finding the session cannot fix within its allowance stops it before the merge step. The hot-fix stays held and its pull request a draft, and the session returns each open finding in its result.
  +
  +#### 10. Merge
  +
  +- Apply [Publish Pull Request](#publish-pull-request) with check results, following [Test Plan](#test-plan).
  +
  +- Apply [Merge Task Pull Requests](#merge-task-pull-requests) for the task pull request, with the project checkout and the unit checkout.
  +- On a confirmed merge, Follow [Task Merge]() in the project checkout with that merge result, the unit's current task and epic evidence, and the board identity the brief names.
  +- Resume the arising-issues step when recording returns; a merge or recording blocker remains explicit.
  +
  +#### 11. Arising Issues
  +
  +- Apply [Save Tracker Issue](#save-tracker-issue) for each issue that arose during delivery as a standalone issue with no agent-engineering prefix.
  +
  +- Follow [Hoist Mode]() in the project checkout with those new issue identities and the allowance the brief names, after the pull request is open and epic delivery is recorded.
  +- Apply [Record Plan Change](#record-plan-change) with each placement it applied and each it held.
  +
  +#### 12. Report the Changes
  +
  +- Apply [Populate Planning Record](#populate-planning-record) with the session's [change list](#change-list) and its planning folder.
  +
  +- Apply [Publish Planning Record](#publish-planning-record) for the record's folder.
  +- Provide the list with the delivery session result, so the user reads each plan change this session applied and each it held.
